<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32479" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκμοχθέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>work out with toil,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κερκίσιν πέπλους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>El.</u>
					307
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>struggle through,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόνους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>IT</u>
					1455
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				825
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Eus.
				<u>PE</u>
				3.11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>win by labour, achieve,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑλένην ἐ. δορί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					873
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκμοχθῶν βίᾳ εὔκλειαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>HF</u>
					1369
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>struggle out of,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς τῶν θεῶν τύχας</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				309
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be worn out,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅσοι δεσμοῖς ἐκμεμόχθηνται βροτῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					332.5
				</span></i>
			 (s. v.l.).</div>
